<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Honeywell raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Honeywell raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it raised its recommendation on Honeywell Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- The open of trading in the shares was delayed by the NYSE because of an order imbalance, but the stock was indicated to open higher at about 71 per share, up from 67-7/8.  </p>
<p>-- Analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
</text>
